{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65736","id":4054829367,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde87JicO9","number":65736,"title":"[release/10.0] Fixing JsonPatchDocument bug ","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":985473549,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5ODU0NzM1NDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/Servicing-approved","name":"Servicing-approved","color":"048708","default":false,"description":"Shiproom has approved the issue","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1118585221,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTE4NTg1MjIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-mvc","name":"area-mvc","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MVC, Actions and Controllers, Localization, CORS, most templates","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/389","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/389","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/389/labels","id":15005069,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84A5PWN","number":389,"title":"10.0.6","description":null,"creator":{"login":"rbhanda","id":30737530,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM3NTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30737530?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda","html_url":"https://github.com/rbhanda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbhanda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":28,"state":"closed","created_at":"2026-03-03T18:23:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T09:28:13Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-04-23T09:28:13Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-10T23:51:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T23:24:46Z","closed_at":"2026-03-11T01:35:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/65736","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65736","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65736.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65736.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-11T01:35:42Z"},"body":"Backport of #65470 to release/10.0\n\n/cc @adityamandaleeka @HPOD00019\n\n# Fixing JsonPatchDocument bug with nested array property traversal\n\nFix JsonPatch operations on nested array element properties\n\n## Description\n\n`ListAdapter.TryTraverse` casts the target to non-generic `IList`, but `JsonArray` only implements generic `IList<JsonNode>`. This causes all JSON Patch operations that traverse into array elements (e.g., `/items/0/name`) to fail with \"target location not found\" when applied to `JsonNode`/`JsonObject` targets. The fix aligns `TryTraverse` with the pattern already used by every other method in the class (`TryAdd`, `TryGet`, `TryRemove`, `TryReplace`, `TryTest`), using `TryGetListTypeArgument` and `GenericListOrJsonArrayUtilities`.\n\nFixes #65409\n\n## Customer Impact\n\nCustomer reported. JSON Patch operations cannot replace, add, remove, or access properties within array elements when applied to `JsonNode`/`JsonObject` instances. For example, a path like `/items/0/name` throws a `JsonPatchException` even though the path is valid per RFC 6902. There is no workaround. The customer is actively waiting for this fix in 10.0 servicing.\n\n## Regression?\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [x] No\n\nThis has been present since `Microsoft.AspNetCore.JsonPatch.SystemTextJson` shipped in 10.0.\n\n## Risk\n\n- [ ] High\n- [ ] Medium\n- [x] Low\n\n5 src lines changed in a single method (`TryTraverse`) to use the same utility methods already called by every other method in the same class. 155 test lines added across 8 new tests.\n\n## Verification\n\n- [ ] Manual (required)\n- [x] Automated\n\n## Packaging changes reviewed?\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [ ] No\n- [x] N/A\n\n----\n\n## When servicing release/2.3\n\n- [ ] Make necessary changes in eng/PatchConfig.props","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65736/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65470","id":3963917000,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde87E7bTm","number":65470,"title":"Fixing JsonPatchDocument bug ","user":{"login":"HPOD00019","id":123089574,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1Yypg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123089574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019","html_url":"https://github.com/HPOD00019","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HPOD00019/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1573516639,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTczNTE2NjM5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/feature-json-patch","name":"feature-json-patch","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2209519932,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5NTE5OTMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/community-contribution","name":"community-contribution","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"Indicates that the PR has been added by a community member","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5351896046,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABPv9z7g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-minimal","name":"area-minimal","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes minimal APIs, endpoint filters, parameter binding, request delegate generator etc","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/379","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/379","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/379/labels","id":14553368,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84A3hEY","number":379,"title":"11.0-preview3","description":"","creator":{"login":"danroth27","id":1874516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzQ1MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1874516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27","html_url":"https://github.com/danroth27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":200,"state":"closed","created_at":"2026-01-15T18:26:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T09:31:23Z","due_on":"2026-04-14T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2026-05-25T09:31:23Z"},"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-02-19T16:41:06Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T23:50:59Z","closed_at":"2026-02-24T20:31:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/65470","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65470","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65470.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65470.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-24T20:31:36Z"},"body":"# Fixing JsonPatchDocument bug with Replace json array item\r\n\r\nThere was a bug when try using \r\n```csharp\r\nJsonPatchDocument.Replace(\"/SomeArray/0/SomeField/\", \"new value\"); \r\n```\r\nduring apply attempt the exception was thrown: \r\n```csharp\r\nMicrosoft.AspNetCore.JsonPatch.SystemTextJson.Exceptions.JsonPatchException: \"For operation 'replace', the target location specified by path '/items/0/id/' was not found.\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Description\r\nProblem was in ListAdapter file, method TryTraverse consumed target parameter as \"object\" type and then tried to cast it to IList, but JsonArray implements only generic IList<JsonNode> (not non-generic IList), so I added condition to proccess it any IList<JsonNode> implementations correctly (instead of just returning null).\r\n\r\nAlso added one test to demonstrate problem (it runs with my insertations).\r\n\r\n\r\nFixes #65409\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65470/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/61313","id":2970952417,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde86RVUFs","number":61313,"title":"Added System.Text.Json serialization-based JsonPatch implementation","user":{"login":"mkArtakMSFT","id":34246760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MjQ2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34246760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT","html_url":"https://github.com/mkArtakMSFT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkArtakMSFT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1118585221,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTE4NTg1MjIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-mvc","name":"area-mvc","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MVC, Actions and Controllers, Localization, CORS, most templates","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/336","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/336","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/336/labels","id":12209552,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84Auk2Q","number":336,"title":"10.0-preview4","description":"","creator":{"login":"danroth27","id":1874516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzQ1MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1874516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27","html_url":"https://github.com/danroth27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":175,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-01-23T15:09:49Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T10:54:47Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2025-07-08T21:38:55Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-04T00:07:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T22:54:25Z","closed_at":"2025-04-21T22:53:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/61313","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/61313","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/61313.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/61313.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-21T22:53:42Z"},"body":"Fixes #24333 \r\n\r\nDesign document: https://gist.github.com/mkArtakMSFT/346cf9d5c6eeb73406185751e28bd8fa\r\n\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\nI've a few benchmarks to compare this implementation with the original implementation and below are results for a few scenarios that I wanted to highlight.\r\n\r\n|                      Type |              Method |       Mean |     Error |     StdDev |  Gen 0 |  Gen 1 | Gen 2 | Allocated |\r\n|-------------------------- |-------------------- |-----------:|----------:|-----------:|-------:|-------:|------:|----------:|\r\n|     ApplicationBenchmarks | NewtonsoftJsonPatch | 271.924 us | 5.4014 us | 12.8370 us | 1.9531 | 1.4648 |     - |     25 KB |\r\n|     ApplicationBenchmarks | SystemTextJsonPatch |   1.584 us | 0.0307 us |  0.0399 us | 0.2365 |      - |     - |      3 KB |\r\n| DeserializationBenchmarks | NewtonsoftJsonPatch |  19.261 us | 0.4241 us |  1.2439 us | 3.5095 | 0.0610 |     - |     43 KB |\r\n| DeserializationBenchmarks | SystemTextJsonPatch |   7.917 us | 0.3401 us |  0.9866 us | 0.5493 |      - |     - |      7 KB |","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/61313/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}